  "lines": [
    {"id":"n01","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"In our town, your last lie floats above your head."},
    {"id":"n02","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"People read each other. So most told the truth."},
    {"id":"n03","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"Mine said I DIDN'T BREAK IT for months."},
    {"id":"n04","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"The music box was Mom's favorite."},
    {"id":"m01","who":"mom","kind":"dialogue","text":"Milo, did you see what happened?"},
    {"id":"m02","who":"hero","kind":"dialogue","text":"No, Mom. I didn't."},
    {"id":"n05","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"Grandpa never asked me to explain."},
    {"id":"g01","who":"grandpa","kind":"dialogue","text":"Some things stay quiet until they are ready."},
    {"id":"n06","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"I thought he helped me hide."},
    {"id":"n07","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"Then his lie changed."},
    {"id":"n08","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"I HAD ONE MORE DAY."},
    {"id":"g02","who":"grandpa","kind":"dialogue","text":"You cannot carry this for me."},
    {"id":"n09","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"He broke the music box."},
    {"id":"n10","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"He let me take the blame."},
    {"id":"g03","who":"grandpa","kind":"dialogue","text":"Your mother needed one good day."},
    {"id":"n11","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"That lie was never mine to keep."},
    {"id":"m03","who":"mom","kind":"dialogue","text":"Milo? Tell me the truth."},
    {"id":"m04","who":"hero","kind":"dialogue","text":"I broke it. And Grandpa said I should wait."},
    {"id":"n12","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"The words rose above me, then disappeared."},
    {"id":"n13","who":"hero","kind":"vo","text":"For the first time in four months, there was nothing to hide."}
  ],
